<title>MAURITIUS: SOCCER-MALAWI BEAT MAURITIUS 2-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MALAWI BEAT MAURITIUS 2-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BELLE VUE, Mauritius 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malawi beat Mauritius 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in an African Nations Cup soccer qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malawi - Bob Mpinganjira (29th min), France Jonas (90th own goal)</p>
<p>Mauritius - Robert Rateau (75th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
